  (text "Annotated on the drawing and drawn here without connections: C29 / C30 0.22 uF snubbers at the HT winding" (at 21.336 256.278 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "7b21550b-769a-4bb8-b4ad-dde452cc87dd"))
  (text "and C31 0.05 uF mains-to-chassis. The 4 A mains fuse, 1 A HT fuse, standby switch and pilot lamp" (at 21.336 260.278 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "353aa8f3-13cb-48d2-9bf2-dbdd79e82ba6"))
  (text "are annotations too, and the 6.3 V heater winding is omitted — see netlist.cir and meta.yaml." (at 21.336 264.278 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "3c26c390-0798-4061-9185-bf6a25a2163f"))
  (text "Four EL34s in parallel push-pull off a silicon bridge — the 100 W head on the model 1987's front end. Heaters, PT primary and pilot lamp omitted." (at 12.7 271.958 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "40669602-f8ef-4037-ac74-e3af76fb95e8"))
  (text "Channel I is the high-treble channel and channel II the normal channel; each has a high- and a low-sensitivity jack, and the two are voiced apart at the cathode." (at 12.7 276.358 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "a0468644-c873-4777-b6bd-fe90ccc5e385"))
